# ============================================================
# ICONOGRAPHY — iconographic motifs
# Alignment strategy:
#   - AAT (skos:exactMatch) where a verified standalone record exists
#   - Wikidata (skos:exactMatch / skos:closeMatch) for symbols
#     not covered by AAT as standalone concepts
#   - skos:scopeNote marks cases where Getty IA
#     may in the future replace/complement the Wikidata QID
# ============================================================

ocra-voc:iconography
